herdbook-spaces is a modified copy of the `spaces` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: preserves manual workspace drag order after one-time
worktree placement, opens herdbook-menu on right-click when installed, and
supports native + pure-JS cross-space drag/drop (`drag.js`) for reordering
workspaces and dropping panes or tabs onto workspaces or `+`. Asset paths were
renamed by Herdr's mod.clone.
